  skill-evals/tools/skill_lint.py
  skill-evals/tools/skill_scanner.py
  skill-evals/tools/run_trigger_evals.py
  .github/workflows/skill-evals.yml

Modifications made in this repository:

  - skill_scanner.py: unmodified. Takes a path argument.
  - skill_lint.py: takes a skill directory as an argument, and its bare-path
    rule no longer flags a repository-relative path that merely contains a
    scripts/ segment.
  - run_trigger_evals.py: SKILLS_ROOT repointed at .claude/skills/, because
    skills live there in this repo rather than under agent_skills/.
  - skill-evals.yml: job paths repointed at .claude/skills/ and skill-evals/,
    and a job added to run this repository's own verification script.

The five-tier eval model in skill-evals/README.md also follows the structure
documented in awesome-llm-apps/agent_skills/evals/README.md, which in turn
credits addyosmani/agent-skills for tiers 1-3 and Anthropic's skill-creator for
the evals.json schema.

The operator tables and device specifications shipped with the skills are
restatements of vendor documentation. Each entry carries its source URL and the
date it was retrieved, in the reference file that holds it.

